The final version
The final précis is due Monday, December 14, submitted as a PDF on Canvas. It should include:

The map — one or more causal diagrams presenting your synthesis of how development happens, with the major mechanisms labeled;
The argument — prose that walks a reader through your map, explains where the course’s major frameworks agree and disagree, and says which claims you find best supported and why;
The evidence — brief notes on what kind of evidence underwrites the key links (historical, cross-country, experimental), and which links you consider weakest.
